+	2026-11-16  Uros Bizjak  <ubizjak@gmail.com>
+
+	PR target/128670
+	* config/i386/i386.cc (classify_argument) <case ARRAY_TYPE>:
+	Classify each element at its actual offset and merge the classes
+	of the elements.
+
+2026-11-22  Guo Jie  <guojie@loongson.cn>
+
+	Backported from master:
+	2026-11-22  Guo Jie  <guojie@loongson.cn>
+
+	* config/loongarch/lasx.md (bitimm256): Remove.  Update all
